Using vcftools filter out:
- INDELs (--remove-indels) 
---max-missing 0.90 - #we can also try with 0.5 and see how it goes) 
- sites that have a minor allele count of less than 3 (--mac 3) #This is relative to genotypes, so it has to be called in at least 1 homozygote and 1 heterozygote or 3 heterozygotes. 

In addition:
--minDP 3 This command will recode genotypes that have less than 3 reads - see Wang et al., 2020 (https://jasbsci.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/s40104-019-0407-9)for minimum depth criteria before imputing GBS datafiles.
--maf 0.05 filter out sites with MAF lower than 5%

#sites filtering
vcftools --gzvcf /gatk/data/Cece/EMCAP_533/variants.selected.vcf.gz --remove-indels --max-missing 0.90 --mac 3 --minDP 3 --maf 0.05 --remove-filtered-geno LowQual --recode --recode-INFO-all --out /gatk/data/Cece/EMCAP_533/chickpea_filtered_missing90.vcf

#check individuals missingness
vcftools --vcf EMCAP_532_SNPs_chr1-8_miss90.vcf.recode.vcf --missing-indv --out missing_chickpea_all_1kindsnps_FINAL_filtered

##check chromosome name
bcftools query -f '%CHROM\n' variants.selected.vcf.gz |uniq

#select biallelic sites
vcftools --vcf chickpea_filtered_missing90.vcf.recode.vcf --min-alleles 2 --max-alleles 2 --recode --recode-INFO-all --out /gatk/data/Cece/EMCAP_533/Chickpea_filtered_miss90_biallelicsites.vcf


# change the chromosome notation which has this prefix: "CDCFrontier_v11|"
#so to change the annotation use bcftools:
bcftools annotate --rename-chrs rename.txt Chickpea_filtered_miss90_biallelicsites.vcf.recode.vcf -Oz -o  EMCAP_532_chr1-8_and_scaffold_miss90.vcf
